# GPS status page (connected, three satellites in view, no fix): opened from the map with the S key. Top of the page, scrolled by two steps (the sky), by five (the bars), and the end.
# Synthetic feed only (tests/tools/gen_nmea.py, an invented point). tests/tools/check_status_shots.py measures the shots.
title GPS status: connected, three satellites in view, no fix
sizes 640x480 480x320 320x480
env DECKATLAS_DEMO 1
env DECKATLAS_GPS auto
env DECKATLAS_GPS_FEED nofix3
env DECKATLAS_VIEW 48.889643,2.269995,16

wait 1800
key s
wait 600
shot top
expect text "Searching for satellites"
key down
key down
wait 300
shot scrolled-1
key down
key down
key down
wait 300
shot scrolled-2
key end
wait 300
shot end
key esc
wait 400
expect text "Map"
expect noquit
